  m_EditorHideFlags: 0
  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: 589a77387c7c4ea488d9368fe6c3cd2f, type: 3}
  m_Name: Start Dialogue
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: 
  characterName: Axion
  dialogues:
  - Welcome to the construction floor! Here you will build your transformer from
    scratch. Before we start, it is good to review the controls.
  - 'The camera controls are as follows:

    - Use W A S D to move the camera

    -
    Use Q and E to rotate the camera

    - Use the mouse wheel to zoom in and out'
  - 'The building controls are as follows:

    - Left mouse button to place a building

    -
    Right mouse button to remove a building

    - Press R to rotate a building

    -
    Press B to toggle build mode

    - Press SPACE to pause and unpause the game'
  - Don't worry! If you get stuck, need a refresher on the controls, or just want
    a recap of the level goal, you can press the ? icon in the top right corner.
  - 'Our very first step is to find a way to ENCODE the resources of our order in
    such a way that it represents both what each item is as well as its position
    in the sequence. '
  - To do this, we must first turn our loose TOKENS into a single MATRIX, which we
    can EMBED via the use of a neural network.
  - Finally, we must add the POSITIONAL information to the EMBEDDING to complete
    the first step.
  - You can find all buildings you need in the build menu below. Good luck!
